flowchart TD
    Start[接收售后 action_type + order facts + policy hits] --> Signals[提取 risk_signals<br/>是否发货/送达/取消/高金额/延迟/低分/疑似滥用/已退款等]
    Signals --> Split{action_type}

    Split -- cancel_order --> CancelCheck{订单状态}
    CancelCheck -- created/approved/invoiced 且低额无风险 --> CancelAuto[approve + execute<br/>低风险自动取消申请]
    CancelCheck -- created/approved/invoiced 但金额高/证据复杂 --> CancelHitl[needs_human_review + HITL]
    CancelCheck -- canceled --> CancelReject1[reject: 已取消]
    CancelCheck -- shipped/delivered --> CancelReject2[reject: 已发货或已送达]

    Split -- change_address --> AddrCheck{物流是否锁定}
    AddrCheck -- 发货前且低额无风险 --> AddrAuto[approve + execute<br/>低风险改址申请]
    AddrCheck -- 发货前但证据复杂 --> AddrHitl[needs_human_review + HITL]
    AddrCheck -- shipped/delivered/canceled --> AddrReject[reject: 物流锁定或订单不可改]

    Split -- refund_request --> RefundCheck{退款事实}
    RefundCheck -- canceled/delay>=7/low_review<=2 --> RefundHitl[needs_human_review + HITL<br/>可建退款核查申请]
    RefundCheck -- 事实不足 --> RefundClarify[ask_clarification<br/>补充原因/异常证据]

    Split -- invoice_request --> InvoiceHitl[needs_human_review<br/>补齐抬头/税号/邮箱]
    Split -- complaint_escalation --> ComplaintHitl[needs_human_review + HITL<br/>投诉工单不承诺补偿结果]
    Split -- open_support_case --> SupportCheck{是否含延迟/低分/补偿/投诉/高额}
    SupportCheck -- 无高风险信号且命中政策 --> SupportAuto[approve + execute<br/>低风险普通跟进工单]
    SupportCheck -- 有风险信号 --> SupportHitl[needs_human_review + HITL]

    CancelAuto --> Verify[Verifier]
    CancelHitl --> Verify
    CancelReject1 --> Verify
    CancelReject2 --> Verify
    AddrAuto --> Verify
    AddrHitl --> Verify
    AddrReject --> Verify
    RefundHitl --> Verify
    RefundClarify --> Verify
    InvoiceHitl --> Verify
    ComplaintHitl --> Verify
    SupportAuto --> Verify
    SupportHitl --> Verify
    Verify --> Next{required_next_step}
    Next -- execute --> Exec[ToolCallManager 执行写工具]
    Next -- hitl --> HITL[interrupt 等人工确认]
    Next -- clarify --> Clarify[向用户要补充信息]
    Next -- stop --> Stop[安全拒绝]
